  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "image": "books/G1/081/p05.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 573,
   "text": "Little Skunk looked at Brother and Sister. He said, \"I have soft, black fur. I have a long, bushy tail. But I do not have white stripes down my back.\" Brother Skunk said, \"All skunks have stripes. You do not have stripes, so maybe you are not a skunk.\"",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    32.34,
    60.16
